<QuestionLayout
  title="How does Traverse verify cross-OS behavior actually matches?"
  description="Architecturally, same-binary execution should behave identically everywhere. The v1.0 milestone treats that as a claim to prove, not assume — a five-platform CI stress matrix is one of ten explicit v1.0 gates, and it isn't fully met yet."
